'''Mizuki Tachibana''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 6.8 increases range and decreases time between attacks, but increases attack animation foreswing.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 391
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Mizuki Tachibana
|name2 = Mizuki Tachibana CC
|name3 = Baseball Mask β
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mizuki Tachibana CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Baseball Mask β''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mizuki is a decent general area fighter, but she performs best against Angel enemies. Treat this unit as though it were [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Food Stall Cat]] but with more range. Mizuki's high speed and intense damage to Angels can be very useful in tough Angel stages like [[Broken Mask]], as It can do 30,600 Damage to angels. It can be used to clear annoying peons out of the way, which can allow you main fighters like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]/[[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Lizard Cat]] to hit the main threats of levels.

